---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site';
const breadcrumbs=[{label:'Cookie Policy',href:'/cookies/'}];
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy | Talon Expeditions" description="Talon Expeditions cookie policy explaining essential cookies, analytics, preference technologies, and how visitors can manage browser controls." breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <section class="content-hero"><div class="shell"><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/><p class="eyebrow">Legal & privacy</p><h1 class="section-title">Cookie Policy</h1><p class="lead">This page explains how cookies and similar browser technologies may be used on the Talon Expeditions website.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="narrow legal-prose"><p><strong>Effective date:</strong> September 10, 2026</p><h2>What cookies are</h2><p>Cookies are small pieces of data that a website can store in a browser. Similar technologies may use local storage, pixels, or identifiers to remember preferences, support website functions, measure traffic, or understand how visitors interact with content.</p><h2>Essential technologies</h2><p>Essential technologies support functions such as security, form behavior, session continuity, consent choices, or other features required for the site to work as expected. These technologies may operate without an advertising or analytics purpose.</p><h2>Analytics and performance</h2><p>Where analytics are enabled, they may help us understand which pages people visit, how they arrived, what devices or browsers they use, and whether the site is functioning well. We use this information to improve navigation, content, search visibility, and technical performance rather than to build unrelated advertising profiles.</p><h2>Marketing technologies</h2><p>If advertising or remarketing tools are introduced in the future, they will be described in the active consent interface and this policy will be updated. Talon Expeditions does not currently need a broad advertising-cookie stack for normal website operation.</p><h2>Managing cookies</h2><p>You can use browser settings to block or delete cookies. Blocking essential storage may affect website functions. Where the site displays a cookie-preference control, you can also use that control to change non-essential preferences.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Questions about website privacy or cookie use can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a>. For broader information about our handling of personal information, see the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
